            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Parrot learned which apps to ignore</h3><ul><li>Dictating into the Claude app no longer starts a recording.</li><li>In automatic mode, the recording notice can now stop and skip that app next time.</li><li>Add any app to Apps to ignore in Settings, under Recording.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.29.13">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
